msgid ""
"`sort_by` takes a custom comparator function that replaces the normal `Ord` "
"comparison logic."
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/foundations-api-design/predictable-api/naming-conventions/by.md:31
msgid ""
"`sort_by_key` takes a projection function that takes the original element "
"and returns an alternate value to use for sorting. This allow us to do "
"things like sort by a particular field of a struct."
msgstr ""

